{'symbol': 'GLW', 'date': '2023-02-08 11:21:00', 'title': 'CORNING ANNOUNCES INCREASE IN QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "CORNING, N.Y., FEB. 08, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CORNING INCORPORATED'S (NYSE: GLW) BOARD OF DIRECTORS TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.28 PER SHARE, A 3.7% INCREASE VERSUS THE COMPANY'S PREVIOUS QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND OF $0.27. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE ON MARCH 30, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON FEB. 28, 2023."}{'symbol': 'GLW', 'date': '2023-02-08 08:30:00', 'title': 'WEST EXPANDS CORNING COLLABORATION AND LAUNCHES FIRST PRODUCT', 'text': "WEST READY PACK™ WITH CORNING VALOR® RTU VIALS UTILIZING STEVANATO GROUP'S EZ-FILL® TECHNOLOGY EXTON, PA. , FEB. 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WEST PHARMACEUTICAL SERVICES, INC. (NYSE: WST), A GLOBAL LEADER IN INNOVATIVE SOLUTIONS FOR INJECTABLE DRUG ADMINISTRATION, TODAY ANNOUNCES THE EXPANSION OF ITS LANDMARK COLLABORATION WITH CORNING INCORPORATED (NYSE: GLW), THAT NOW INCLUDES THE EXCLUSIVE DISTRIBUTION RIGHTS FOR CORNING VALOR® GLASS VIALS AND THE LAUNCH OF ITS FIRST PRODUCT, WEST READY PACK™ WITH CORNING VALOR® RTU VIALS UTILIZING SG EZ-FILL® TECHNOLOGY."}